      "mergedPostDetails": "I am having an issue where changing my avatar from the VRChat website no longer works correctly. The problem started randomly about a week ago. Before this, changing avatars from the website worked normally. Now, when I go to the VRChat website and click “Change Into Avatar,” it says the avatar was changed successfully, and my website profile updates to show that avatar. However, when I open VRChat, my avatar does not change. I have tested this with multiple public avatars, including the default robot avatar, and the issue happens every time. The avatar also does not appear in my Recent Avatars in-game, changing avatars from inside VRChat works normally. The issue only happens when trying to change my avatar from the website.\n\nMy VRChat account in-game and on the website appears to be the same account. My username matches, and I can change avatars normally inside the game. It also says \"avatar changed successfully\" but nothing changes in game",
      "mergedPostTitle": "avatar not working",
